<title>RUSSIA: Russia Oct output up 7 pct, down 4.0 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Russia Oct output up 7 pct, down 4.0 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production in October was 7.0 percent higher than in September but was four percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	OCT 96   SEPT 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  +7	  +1	  +4</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    -4	  -7	  -2</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
